⚡️ There is a pattern emerging. There have been major anti-government riots in over a dozen countries in the past 30 days: 

Albania, France, Italy, Spain, Belgium, Tunisia, India, Argentina, Portugal, Chile, Mexico, Ecuador, Kosovo.

@MedmanNews

⚡️🇦🇱 The Albanians are also rioting this week! It appears they have already set fire to their parliament. The building in the attached video is their Supreme Court, also on fire.

The Albanian rioters are demanding that their prime minister Edi Rama resign because of rampant corruption, rising costs of education, etc. Rama also chose to partner with Jared Kushner’s private equity investment firm, Affinity Partners, to build a $1.4 billion luxury resort on public land.

